j-49-217-i002"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>M, male; F, female; BMI, body mass index; BP, blood pressure.</p><p>Data are expressed as means&#x000b1;SD.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Comparison of Clinical Characteristics Among Subjects at Baseline Between the Old IFG Group and the Newly Included IFG Group</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ymj-49-217-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>BMI, body mass index; BP, blood pressure.</p><p>Data are expressed as means&#x000b1;SD.</p><p>Old IFG was defined as a fasting plasma glucose value of 6.1 - 7.0 mmol/L (110 - 125 mg/dL) in the absence of previous diagnosis of diabetes. Newly included diabetes was as a fasting plasma glucose value of 5.6 - 6.0 mmol/L (100 - 109 mg/dL) in the absence of previous diagnosis of diabetes.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>